FRABBIT modifies RABBIT: it is renamed to FRABBIT/frabbit, adds a French
(fr-FR) locale, points update/download URLs at ReaperAccessible, and makes
various behavioural changes. Such modifications are marked in the project's
git history and CHANGELOG.md.
